        "html": "<h1 id=\"reading-list\">Reading list</h1>\n<p>Every form of a <code>LINK</code> block.</p>\n<p>One line, with a colon and a URL:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/soil\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">https://garden.example/soil</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div></div>\n<p>One line, without a colon:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/seeds\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">https://garden.example/seeds</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div></div>\n<p>One line, with the other keyword:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/bees\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">https://garden.example/bees</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div></div>\n<p>One line, with the other keyword and without a colon:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/ponds\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">https://garden.example/ponds</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div></div>\n<p>One line, with a Markdown link:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/mulch\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">A guide to mulch</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div></div>\n<p>One line, with a link to a note:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"/10+Garden/Compost+basics\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">Compost basics</span></a></div></div>\n<p>One line, with a link to a note and a label:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"/10+Garden/Rain+barrel\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">The barrel</span></a></div></div>\n<p>A list, with a URL:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/tools\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">https://garden.example/tools</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div></div>\n<p>A list, without a colon, with a link to a note:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"/10+Garden/Herb+bed/Thyme\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">Thyme</span></a></div></div>\n<p>A list, with the other keyword and without a colon:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/hedges\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">https://garden.example/hedges</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div></div>\n<p>A list of more than five lines, with every kind of target:</p>\n<div class=\"link-cards\"><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/spring\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">https://garden.example/spring</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/summer\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">https://garden.example/summer</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/autumn\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">Autumn jobs</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"/10+Garden/Frost+dates+explained\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">Frost dates explained</span></a></div><div class=\"link-card\"><span class=\"not-published\">Winter plan (draft)</span></div><div class=\"link-card\"><a class=\"link-card-link\" href=\"https://garden.example/winter\"><span class=\"link-card-title\">https://garden.example/winter</span><span class=\"link-card-source\">garden.example</span></a></div></div>\n<p>A block where nothing can show, because its only target is on the deny list:</p>\n\n<p>A block where nothing can show, because its only target does not exist:</p>\n\n<p>Not a <code>LINK</code> line, because it is inside a code block:</p>\n<pre class=\"language-text\" data-language=\"text\"><code class=\"language-text\">LINK: https://garden.example/not-a-card\n</code></pre>\n<p>Not a <code>LINK</code> line, because it is inline code: <code>LINK: https://garden.example/inline</code>.</p>\n<p>Not a <code>LINK</code> line, because it is in a comment:</p>\n<p>Not a <code>LINK</code> line, because it is in an HTML comment:</p>\n\n<p>Not a <code>LINK</code> line, because it is a saved row of a frozen query:</p>\n\n\n<p>LINK: <a href=\"https://garden.example/frozen\">https://garden.example/frozen</a></p>\n"
